## Actual WebSearch / WebFetch trace

이번 surgical retake에서 Buffer 공식 scheduling 문서를 다시 실제 검색했고, 같은 v7.1 critic chain에서 Buffer All Channels와 Sprout 공식 approval 문서를 실제 검색·열람한 trace를 재사용했다.

```json
{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":{"query":"site:support.buffer.com scheduling posts customize each channel publish now schedule official Buffer"}}
{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":{"query":"site:support.buffer.com all channels view drafts approvals queue sent official Buffer"}}
{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":{"query":"site:support.sproutsocial.com message approval workflows compose needs approval calendar official Sprout"}}
